Ladder Flags

Flag artwork by Twitter, Inc. and other Twemoji contributors, distributed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji/tree/v17.0.3

The color font was built by poppingmoon using the Mozilla Foundation's
twemoji-colr tooling. The project's code is licensed under Apache 2.0.
https://github.com/poppingmoon/twemoji-colr/blob/v0.7.0%2B2026.09.09/LICENSE.md

Ladder used TwemojiMozilla.ttf from the following release, with SHA-256
1a04f7bd9bd74434797e61b48b6e00f07740dd98458d9d6f8927a039bc17688c.
https://github.com/poppingmoon/twemoji-colr/releases/tag/v0.7.0%2B2026.09.09

Ladder subset the font with fontTools 4.60.1, keeping U+1F1E6..1F1FF,
U+1F3F4, U+E0061..E007A and U+E007F with their ligatures and color layers.
It removed the FFTM table, renamed the font family to Ladder Flags, and
added artwork attribution and license information to the font's name table.
